{%- set banned_block = "" %}
{%- if banned_words %}
{%- set bw_lines = ["", "BANNED WORDS — never use these or close variations:"] %}
{%- for w in banned_words %}
{%- set _ = bw_lines.append('  ✗ "' ~ w ~ '"') %}
{%- endfor %}
{%- set _ = bw_lines.append("") %}
{%- set banned_block = bw_lines | join("\n") %}
{%- endif %}

{{ language_instruction }}

{{ brand_context }}

Rewrite the content below 3 separate times for {{ platform_label }}, each
using a distinctly different strategic angle — not just a different tone,
a genuinely different choice of what to lead with and emphasize.

Angle 1 — Contrarian: Challenge the conventional wisdom on this topic.
  Lead with what most people get wrong.
Angle 2 — Personal story: Lead with the lived experience or specific
  moment behind this — the "why", not just the "what".
Angle 3 — Concrete outcome: Lead with the specific, measurable result —
  a number, a timeframe, a before/after — using only real details from
  the source content, never an invented statistic.

Rules for all 3 rewrites:
- Full-length content for {{ platform_label }}, not a snippet or teaser
- Must match the brand voice exactly
- Every sentence must earn its place with a specific detail from the
  source content — delete anything generic enough to apply to any brand
- Never invent facts, numbers, or claims not in the source content
- Never use em dashes (—) anywhere in the output
{{ language_instruction }}
{{ banned_block }}
SOURCE CONTENT:
{{ content }}

Return valid JSON only:
{
  "angles": [
    {"name": "Contrarian", "rationale": "one sentence on why this framing works here", "content": "the full rewritten piece"},
    {"name": "Personal story", "rationale": "...", "content": "..."},
    {"name": "Concrete outcome", "rationale": "...", "content": "..."}
  ]
}
